Let nums be a list of 1, 0, -1, 0, -2, and 2.
Let target be 0.
Sort nums.
Let n be count of nums.

For every i from 0 to n - 1:
    If i > 0 and item i of nums is item (i - 1) of nums:
        Continue.
    For every j from i + 1 to n - 1:
        If j > i + 1 and item j of nums is item (j - 1) of nums:
            Continue.
        For every k from j + 1 to n - 1:
            If k > j + 1 and item k of nums is item (k - 1) of nums:
                Continue.
            For every l from k + 1 to n - 1:
                If l > k + 1 and item l of nums is item (l - 1) of nums:
                    Continue.
                Let total be item i of nums + item j of nums + item k of nums + item l of nums.
                If total is target:
                    Print item i of nums.
                    Print item j of nums.
                    Print item k of nums.
                    Print item l of nums.
                    Print "---".
